request_reply.h, function_call.h and sample.h in this directory are the machine-readable
files of the C++ language binding of the OMG specification "Remote Procedure Call over
DDS" (DDS-RPC), version 1.0, as published in omg-dds-rpc-cxx.zip at
https://www.omg.org/spec/DDS-RPC/20160215/ . They are shipped byte for byte as published
(the line ends are CRLF); omg-dds-rpc-cxx.sha256 holds the SHA-256 of each file.

